      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Ekriathe's Breath",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Iapholi breathes a gout of energy powered by one of her past lives. She chooses whether this affects a 60-foot line or a 30-foot cone. She also chooses one of the following damage types that the breath deals, which also affects the type of DC 25 basic saving throw affected creatures attempt to reduce the damage:\n\n8d6 bludgeoning (DC 25 basic Fortitude save)\n\n8d6 electricity (DC 25 basic Reflex save)\n\n8d6 fire (DC 25 basic Reflex save)\n\n8d6 poison (DC 25 basic Fortitude save)\n\n8d6 sonic (DC 25 basic Fortitude save)\n\n8d6 spirit (DC 25 basic Will save)\n\nThe breath deals 8d6 damage. Ekriathe's Breath gains the trait associated with the chosen damage type. Iapholi can't use Ekriathe's Breath again for 1d4 rounds."
